  "description": "SketchFlow is a layered graffiti font, inspired by street visual art and wants to apply in the form of fonts, this is the result of experiments combining graffiti sketch visuals. There are 3 fonts in 1 family (Stroke, Medium, Bold) all in one capital glyph, and when combined the three fonts into one unit will make your urban design project easy and fast, or even make you an instant graffiti artist.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>SketchFlow is a layered graffiti font, inspired by street visual art and wants to apply in the form of fonts, this is the result of experiments combining graffiti sketch visuals. There are 3 fonts in 1 family (Stroke, Medium, Bold) all in one capital glyph, and when combined the three fonts into one unit will make your urban design project easy and fast, or even make you an instant graffiti artist.</p>",
